<title>UK: Banque Sofinco sets 400 million Ffr step-up FRN.</title>
<headline>Banque Sofinco sets 400 million Ffr step-up FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated step-up</p>
<p>callable floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager</p>
<p>Compaignie Parisienne de Reescompte.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANQUE SOFINCO</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN FFR   BASE	 3M-PIBOR  MATURITY    20.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    *52 BP     PAY DATE    18.DEC.96</p>
<p> REOFFER    99.977    ISS PRICE  101.277   FULL FEES   1.70</p>
<p> LISTING    PARIS     DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST FIVE YEARS THEN IF NOT CALLED AT PAR ON</p>
<p>		19.DEC.01, STEPS-UP TO 3M-PIBOR +127 BP.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
